# Reference library of third-party standards (ACR, ART, Verra, IPCC, FCPF,
# GOFC-GOLD). Roughly 900 MB including geodatabases, with single files well
# over GitHub's 100 MB hard limit, and redistributing other organisations'
# methodology documents from a public repo is a separate question from citing
# them. Kept locally as the source for the registry sections.
references/standards/

# macOS. The AppleDouble sidecars appear because this repo lives on an exFAT
# volume, which has no native support for extended attributes. Sweep them with
# `dot_clean -m .` before committing.
.DS_Store
._*
.AppleDouble
.AppleDB
.AppleDesktop
.LSOverride
.DocumentRevisions-V100
.fseventsd
.Spotlight-V100
.TemporaryItems
.Trashes
.VolumeIcon.icns
.com.apple.timemachine.donotpresent

